        array("id" => "s2e30", "season" => 2, "number" => 30, "name" => "Bastet's Mariah, Part 1", "airdate" => "13 Feb 2015", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 8.2, "summary" => "On the way to Luxor, Joseph notices an electrical outlet set in a rock. Fascinated by the rare sight, Joseph goes in for a closer look and gets shocked. Though he seems fine afterwards, soon all manner of small accidents begin to occur around him.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/135/337648.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2e31", "season" => 2, "number" => 31, "name" => "Bastet's Mariah, Part 2", "airdate" => "20 Feb 2015", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 8.6, "summary" => "Due to the powers of an enemy Stand, Joseph's body becomes magnetized. While chasing after the woman he suspects is the Stand user, Joseph learns that Avdol has also become magnetized from touching a different electrical outlet.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/135/337649.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2e32", "season" => 2, "number" => 32, "name" => "Set's Alessi, Part 1", "airdate" => "27 Feb 2015", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 8, "summary" => "While Joseph and Avdol are fighting with Mariah, Jotaro gets concerned that they haven't shown up yet, and goes to look for them around Luxor. Then, Polnareff senses someone following them and confronts the man.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/135/337650.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2e33", "season" => 2, "number" => 33, "name" => "Set's Alessi, Part 2", "airdate" => "6 Mar 2015", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 8.2, "summary" => "Because of the power of Alessi's Stand, Set, Polnareff is turned back into a child. The one who came to his aid amidst his confusion was a woman named Marena. However, Alessi's evil hands followed Polnareff into her house.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/135/337651.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2e34", "season" => 2, "number" => 34, "name" => "D'Arby the Gambler, Part 1", "airdate" => "13 Mar 2015", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 8.6, "summary" => "Arriving in Cairo, the Stardust Crusaders try to discover where Dio is, only to encounter D'Arby the Gambler. He is willing to give them the information they want, but only if they bet their souls against him in a game.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/135/337652.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2e35", "season" => 2, "number" => 35, "name" => "D'Arby the Gambler, Part 2", "airdate" => "20 Mar 2015", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9.2, "summary" => "With Joseph and Polnareff taken, Jotaro stands up to play D'Arby in a game of poker. With Osiris ready to steal Jotaro's soul, D'Arby is confident until he notices Jotaro's icy calm.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/135/337653.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2e36", "season" => 2, "number" => 36, "name" => "Hol Horse and Boingo, Part 1", "airdate" => "27 Mar 2015", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 8, "summary" => "Hol Horse tries to take out Jotaro's group again, and enlists the future-telling Boingo to aid him.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/135/337654.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2e37", "season" => 2, "number" => 37, "name" => "Hol Horse and Boingo, Part 2", "airdate" => "3 Apr 2015", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 8, "summary" => "Every time Boingo makes a prediction and Hol Horse tries to follow it, it goes wrong.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/135/337655.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2e38", "season" => 2, "number" => 38, "name" => "The Guardian of Hell: Pet Shop, Part 1", "airdate" => "10 Apr 2015", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 8.4, "summary" => "Iggy separates from the group and has a bizarre adventure of his own.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/135/337656.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2e39", "season" => 2, "number" => 39, "name" => "The Guardian of Hell: Pet Shop, Part 2", "airdate" => "17 Apr 2015", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 8.6, "summary" => "Under attack by Pet Shop and his Horus, Iggy has no choice but to flee into the sewers. Iggy can only hide using The Fool as the fearsome Pet Shop continues his barrage of ice attacks.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/135/337657.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2e40", "season" => 2, "number" => 40, "name" => "D'Arby the Player, Part 1", "airdate" => "24 Apr 2015", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 8.4, "summary" => "Inside Dio's mansion, Terence T. D'Arby uses his Atum to drag the group into an illusion. With their souls on the line, the gang meet his challenge in a series of video games.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/135/337658.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2e41", "season" => 2, "number" => 41, "name" => "D'Arby the Player, Part 2", "airdate" => "1 May 2015", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 8.4, "summary" => "Kakyoin is defeated by D'Arby and has his soul sealed inside of a puppet. Despite having no knowledge of games, Jotaro faces D'Arby next in a baseball game.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/135/337659.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2e42", "season" => 2, "number" => 42, "name" => "The Miasma of the Void, Vanilla Ice, Part 1", "airdate" => "8 May 2015", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 8.6, "summary" => "As Jotaro and Joseph continue to face off against D'Arby, Avdol and the others continue to explore the mansion. Little do they know that Dio's servant is watching them and unleashes his terrifying power.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/135/337660.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2e43", "season" => 2, "number" => 43, "name" => "The Miasma of the Void, Vanilla Ice, Part 2", "airdate" => "15 May 2015", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9, "summary" => "Vanilla Ice, now powered up by Dio, uses his Cream to disintegrate Avdol. Iggy and Polnareff desperately try to fight back, but he remains too powerful for the duo to take down.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/135/337661.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2e44", "season" => 2, "number" => 44, "name" => "The Miasma of the Void, Vanilla Ice, Part 3", "airdate" => "22 May 2015", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9, "summary" => "Polnareff is ready to accept his defeat, only to be rescued by the dying Iggy and harden's his resolve. Suzi comforts her daughter as Jotaro and Joseph get closer to where Dio lies in wait.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/135/337662.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2e45", "season" => 2, "number" => 45, "name" => "Dio's World, Part 1", "airdate" => "29 May 2015", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9.2, "summary" => "The Joestar group begin the fight against Dio, as Kakyoin learns the full extent of Dio's true power.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/135/337663.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2e46", "season" => 2, "number" => 46, "name" => "Dio's World, Part 2", "airdate" => "5 Jun 2015", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9.8, "summary" => "Kakyoin discovers The World's true power. The fight between Jotaro and Dio begins.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/424/1060839.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2e47", "season" => 2, "number" => 47, "name" => "Dio's World, Part 3", "airdate" => "12 Jun 2015", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9.8, "summary" => "The fight between Jotaro and Dio continues.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/135/337665.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2e48", "season" => 2, "number" => 48, "name" => "Long Travels, Goodbye My Friend", "airdate" => "19 Jun 2015", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9.8, "summary" => "The final battle between Jotaro and Dio comes to a climactic end.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/135/337666.jpg"),
    )),
    array("number" => 3, "name" => "Diamond Is Unbreakable", "rating" => 8.4, "episodes" => array(
        array("id" => "s3e1", "season" => 3, "number" => 1, "name" => "Jotaro Kujo! Meets Josuke Higashikata", "airdate" => "1 Apr 2016", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 7.8, "summary" => "Ten years after battle in Egypt, Jotaro Kujo arrives to Morioh in Japan looking for Josuke Higashikata. He need to talk to Josuke about Joestar's heritage and tells him about dangerous Stand User who's hiding in town.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/78/196926.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s3e2", "season" => 3, "number" => 2, "name" => "Josuke Higashikata! Meets Angelo", "airdate" => "8 Apr 2016", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 8.3, "summary" => "Angelo uses his Aqua Necklace to attack Josuke's family and succeeds in killing his grandfather. Hungry for revenge, Jotaro and Josuke prepare to fight Angelo once more.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/78/196927.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s3e3", "season" => 3, "number" => 3, "name" => "The Nijimura Brothers, Part 1", "airdate" => "15 Apr 2016", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 7.8, "summary" => "Angelo reveals that he was given his Stand by a man in a school uniform using an arrow. Josuke and Koichi pass by a wrecked house where they discover the brothers Okuyasu and Keicho.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/424/1061471.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s3e4", "season" => 3, "number" => 4, "name" => "The Nijimura Brothers, Part 2", "airdate" => "22 Apr 2016", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 8, "summary" => "After defeating Okuyasu and The Hand, Josuke enters the house to save Koichi. However, he soons find himself under attack by Keicho and his army Stand, Bad Company.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/78/196930.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s3e5", "season" => 3, "number" => 5, "name" => "The Nijimura Brothers, Part 3", "airdate" => "29 Apr 2016", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 8.3, "summary" => "Josuke and Koichi learn that the Nijimura brothers were giving people Stands to try and create one that could save their father. But just as a ceasefire begins, another enemy Stand appears before them.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/78/196931.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s3e6", "season" => 3, "number" => 6, "name" => "Koichi Hirose (Reverb)", "airdate" => "6 May 2016", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 7.3, "summary" => "Koichi finds himself stalked by Tamami Kobayashi, who tries to scam him using The Lock. But when his family is in Tamami's crosshairs, Koichi finally awakens the power of his Stand, Echoes.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/78/196932.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s3e7", "season" => 3, "number" => 7, "name" => "Toshikazu Hazamada (Show Off)", "airdate" => "13 May 2016", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 7.3, "summary" => "Josuke and Koichi get info that a student at their school, Toshikazu Hazamada may be a Stand user and decide to look into the case. Their suspicions are quickly confirmed after Hazamada's wooden doll morphs into an exact copy of Josuke, and attacks them.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/424/1061606.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s3e8", "season" => 3, "number" => 8, "name" => "Yukako Yamagishi Falls In Love, Part 1", "airdate" => "20 May 2016", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 7.8, "summary" => "Koichi finds that he has captured the attention of Yukako Yamagishi, who claims to be in love with him. Things seem fine, until Yukako reveals that her feelings for Koichi go far beyond a simple crush.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/424/1061612.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s3e9", "season" => 3, "number" => 9, "name" => "Yukako Yamagishi Falls In Love, Part 2", "airdate" => "27 May 2016", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 8, "summary" => "Now Yukako's prisoner, Koichi tries to escape the deranged woman using Echoes. But when he is pushed into a corner by Love Deluxe, a new power awakens within Echoes.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/78/196936.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s3e10", "season" => 3, "number" => 10, "name" => "Let's Go Eat Some Italian Food", "airdate" => "3 Jun 2016", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 8.6, "summary" => "Josuke and Okuyasu decide to eat some Italian at a new restaurant run by Tonio Trussardi. However, the food starts affecting Okuyasu and Josuke in strange ways, as Tonio appears to have a Stand.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/424/1061613.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s3e11", "season" => 3, "number" => 11, "name" => "Red Hot Chili Pepper, Part 1", "airdate" => "10 Jun 2016", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 8.2, "summary" => "The electric Stand Red Hot Chili Pepper appears to taunt Josuke before vanishing. The gang learn that its user is targeting Joseph Joestar, and attempt to stop Chili Pepper from killing him.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/78/196938.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s3e12", "season" => 3, "number" => 12, "name" => "Red Hot Chili Pepper, Part 2", "airdate" => "17 Jun 2016", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 8.2, "summary" => "Josuke and the gang continue to fight Red Hot Chili Pepper and its user, Akira Otoishi. Powered up by electricity, Red Hot Chili Pepper proves to be a powerful for as Joseph's boat gets closer to Morioh.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/78/196939.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s3e13", "season" => 3, "number" => 13, "name" => "We Picked Up Something Crazy!", "airdate" => "24 Jun 2016", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 8, "summary" => "Josuke and Joseph find an invisible baby and adopt it.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/78/196940.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s3e14", "season" => 3, "number" => 14, "name" => "Let's Go to the Manga Artist's House, Part 1", "airdate" => "1 Jul 2016", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 8.4, "summary" => "Hazamada and Koichi learn that one of their favorite mangaka, Rohan Kishibe, learns in Morioh. But when they go to visit him, the eccentric Rohan greets them with his Stand, Heaven's Door.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/78/196941.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s3e15", "season" => 3, "number" => 15, "name" => "Let's Go to the Manga Artist's House, Part 2", "airdate" => "8 Jul 2016", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 8.6, "summary" => "Rohan uses Heaven's Door to read the secrets of Josuke's friends and puts them under special locks so that they can't stop him. Angered at seeing his friends hurt, Josuke approaches Rohan.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/424/1061626.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s3e16", "season" => 3, "number" => 16, "name" => "Let's Go Hunting!", "airdate" => "15 Jul 2016", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 8.2, "summary" => "Josuke and Jotaro go hunting for a rat that has been given Stand abilities. While searching for their target, they find living things melted into flesh cubes and soon learn it isn't as simple as a mere rat.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/78/196949.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s3e17", "season" => 3, "number" => 17, "name" => "Rohan Kishibe's Adventure", "airdate" => "22 Jul 2016", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9, "summary" => "Rohan and Koichi investigate a strange alley in Morioh that does not appear on any map. They get more than they bargained for when they meet the ghosts of Reimi and Arnold, who warn them of a dangerous presence in Morioh.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/424/1061633.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s3e18", "season" => 3, "number" => 18, "name" => "Shigechi's Harvest, Part 1", "airdate" => "29 Jul 2016", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 8, "summary" => "Josuke and Okuyasu see strange hornet Stands, belonging to Shigechi, stealing money from all around Morioh. The three work together in a get rich quick scheme that soon goes awry.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/424/1061645.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s3e19", "season" => 3, "number" => 19, "name" => "Shigechi's Harvest, Part 2", "airdate" => "5 Aug 2016", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 8.2, "summary" => "Shigechi, Okuyasu, and Josuke find themselves blinded by greed as they fight over a lottery ticket. When Stands get involved, it turns into a mad brawl over who will get the money.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/78/196952.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s3e20", "season" => 3, "number" => 20, "name" => "Yukaku Yamagishi Dreams of Cinderella", "airdate" => "12 Aug 2016", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 8, "summary" => "Yukako is feeling down about her looks when she meets Aya Tsuji and Cinderella. She offers to give Yukako a makeover, but little does she know that such beauty comes with a price.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/78/196953.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s3e21", "season" => 3, "number" => 21, "name" => "Yoshikage Kira Just Wants to Live Quietly, Part 1", "airdate" => "19 Aug 2016", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9, "summary" => "Yoshikage Kira is a simple businessman who just wants to enjoy his sandwich for lunch. But a minor scuffle with Shigechi escalates when a horrific secret is revealed.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/424/1061650.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s3e22", "season" => 3, "number" => 22, "name" => "Yoshikage Kira Just Wants to Live Quietly, Part 2", "airdate" => "26 Aug 2016", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9.2, "summary" => "Shigechi desperately tries to flee from Yoshikage Kira and Killer Queen, which can turn anything into a bomb. As he perishes, Shigechi gets a clue to Josuke and the others that sets them on a new path.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/78/196955.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s3e23", "season" => 3, "number" => 23, "name" => "Sheer Heart Attack, Part 1", "airdate" => "2 Sep 2016", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9, "summary" => "Kira uses Sheer Heart Attack to kill his tailor and fight Josuke to prevent anyone from learning his secret. The indestructible tank proves to be tough, until Echoes manages to evolve yet again into Act 3.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/78/196956.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s3e24", "season" => 3, "number" => 24, "name" => "Sheer Heart Attack, Part 2", "airdate" => "9 Sep 2016", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9.2, "summary" => "With Sheer Heart Attack beaten, Jotaro and Koichi finally encounter Kira himself. It seems like the final battle is underway as Stands clash, but then...", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/78/196957.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s3e25", "season" => 3, "number" => 25, "name" => "Atom Heart Father", "airdate" => "16 Sep 2016", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 8.4, "summary" => "Searching for more clues about Kira, Josuke and the others investigate his old house. But Kira's father, still alive as a ghost, is determined to protect his son and unleashes Atom Heart Father on them.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/424/1061821.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s3e26", "season" => 3, "number" => 26, "name" => "Janken Boy Is Coming!", "airdate" => "23 Sep 2016", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 7.6, "summary" => "Rohan encounters a boy named Ken, who is obsessed with janken. He accepts the boys challenge, only to end up playing a dangerous game with his Stand, Boy II Man.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/78/196959.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s3e27", "season" => 3, "number" => 27, "name" => "I'm an Alien", "airdate" => "30 Sep 2016", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 8, "summary" => "Josuke and Okuyasu encounter a weird boy named Mikitaka, who claims to be an alien. Possessing weird powers but no Stand, Mikitaka appears to be telling the truth as Josuke gets an idea.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/78/196960.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s3e28", "season" => 3, "number" => 28, "name" => "Highway Go Go, Part 1", "airdate" => "7 Oct 2016", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 8.4, "summary" => "Rohan and Josuke's game ends without Mikitala being discovered. As Rohan discovers something odd while on the train, a boy named Hayato suspects that his dad is acting strange.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/78/196961.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s3e29", "season" => 3, "number" => 29, "name" => "Highway Go Go, Part 2", "airdate" => "14 Oct 2016", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 8.6, "summary" => "Rohan has his energy drained by a nefarious Stand in Futatsumori Tunnel. Josuke flees the pursuing Highway Star on a motorcycle to try and track down its user at the hospital in town.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/80/200136.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s3e30", "season" => 3, "number" => 30, "name" => "Cats Love Yoshikage Kira", "airdate" => "21 Oct 2016", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 8.4, "summary" => "Kira has stolen the identity of another man to live in his house. He discovers a dead cat and buries it, only for the cat to resurrect as a Stand that still has a desire for revenge.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/81/203546.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s3e31", "season" => 3, "number" => 31, "name" => "July 15th (Thurs), Part 1", "airdate" => "28 Oct 2016", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 8.2, "summary" => "On July 15th, Josuke and the others discover a man living in an electric pylon and fall under the spell of Super Fly. Even stranger things then start happening over Morioh.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/82/205948.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s3e32", "season" => 3, "number" => 32, "name" => "July 15th (Thurs), Part 2", "airdate" => "4 Nov 2016", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 8.4, "summary" => "While Rohan deals with an odd architect who is terrified of his own back, Josuke defeats Super Fly only to encounter Terunosuke and his paper controlling Enigma.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/424/1061832.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s3e33", "season" => 3, "number" => 33, "name" => "July 15th (Thurs), Part 3", "airdate" => "11 Nov 2016", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 8.6, "summary" => "Josuke succumbs to fear and is turned into paper , leading Yuya and Highway Star to save him. Rohan looks at the architect's back and becomes cursed by the Stand Cheap Trick.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/84/210899.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s3e34", "season" => 3, "number" => 34, "name" => "July 15th (Thurs), Part 4", "airdate" => "18 Nov 2016", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 8, "summary" => "Rohan tries to prevent anyway from seeing his back to avoid Cheap Trick's curse. Hayato sees Kira in action and confronts the imposter posing as his dad with hard evidence.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/85/213146.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s3e35", "season" => 3, "number" => 35, "name" => "Bites the Dust, Part 1", "airdate" => "25 Nov 2016", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9.2, "summary" => "Kira gets a new power and tests it out on Hayato.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/86/215570.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s3e36", "season" => 3, "number" => 36, "name" => "Bites the Dust, Part 2", "airdate" => "2 Dec 2016", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9.8, "summary" => "Hayato has gone back in time and attempts to warn everyone about Kira, but will he able to stop history from repeating?", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/87/218454.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s3e37", "season" => 3, "number" => 37, "name" => "Shining D (Diamond) is Unbreakable, Part 1", "airdate" => "9 Dec 2016", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9.2, "summary" => "Having inadvertently revealed his true identity to Josuke, Yoshikage Kira is forced to fight him alongside Okuyasu, but does he have a trick up his sleeve?", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/88/221495.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s3e38", "season" => 3, "number" => 38, "name" => "Shining D (Diamond) is Unbreakable, Part 2", "airdate" => "16 Dec 2016", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 10, "summary" => "The battle between Josuke and Kira continues", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/89/223279.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s3e39", "season" => 3, "number" => 39, "name" => "Goodbye, Morioh - The Heart of Gold", "airdate" => "23 Dec 2016", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9.8, "summary" => "The final battle between Kira and the Morioh Warriors comes to a climactic end.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/90/225913.jpg"),
    )),
    array("number" => 4, "name" => "Golden Wind", "rating" => 9.1, "episodes" => array(
        array("id" => "s4e1", "season" => 4, "number" => 1, "name" => "Golden Experience", "airdate" => "5 Oct 2018", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 8.6, "summary" => "Giorno Giovanna has a dream, to become a Gang-Star! Inspired by a man he saved as a child, he sets out to join the shady organisation, Passione. Accompanied by his fellow gang members, Bruno, Mista, Narancia and Fugo, he unearths a terrifying secret about the…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/197/493640.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s4e2", "season" => 4, "number" => 2, "name" => "Buccellati Is Coming", "airdate" => "12 Oct 2018", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9.2, "summary" => "Giorno is attacked by the mysterious Bruno Bucciarati. Using his Stand, Sticky Fingers, he relentlessly pursues Giorno. As he continues his fight with Bruno, Giorno reflects on his past and his decision to become a Gang-Star.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/197/493641.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s4e3", "season" => 4, "number" => 3, "name" => "Meet the Gangster Behind the Wall", "airdate" => "19 Oct 2018", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9, "summary" => "In order to join the Passione organization, Giorno meets with Polpo, one of the capos in the gang who is currently in prison. He gives Giorno a test to prove his worth: keep a lighter burner for 24 hours without going out.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/197/493642.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s4e4", "season" => 4, "number" => 4, "name" => "Joining the Gang", "airdate" => "26 Oct 2018", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9.2, "summary" => "Polpo's Stand, Black Sabbath, begins a relentless attack against Giorno from the shadows. As night begins to fall, Giorno is desperate to defeat his powerful foe. Will he be able to prove his worth and join the gang?", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/197/493643.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s4e5", "season" => 4, "number" => 5, "name" => "Find Polpo's Fortune!", "airdate" => "2 Nov 2018", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9, "summary" => "Bruno introduces Giorno to the other members of his team, who do not take kindly to the newcomer. In order to rise through the ranks, Bruno decides to track down Polpo's hidden fortune. The team heads to Capri to find the lost treasure.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/197/493644.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s4e6", "season" => 4, "number" => 6, "name" => "Moody Blues' Counterattack", "airdate" => "9 Nov 2018", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9, "summary" => "As the team is attacked by an unseen enemy, Abbacchio uses the power of his Stand, Moody Blues, to replay the past and understand the nature of their opponent.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/197/493645.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s4e7", "season" => 4, "number" => 7, "name" => "Six Bullets Appears, Part 1", "airdate" => "16 Nov 2018", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9, "summary" => "Torturing their enemy for information, the team learns that another Stand user is aiming to ambush them on Capri. Mista and Giorno go alone to the island to catch the enemy off guard.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/197/493646.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s4e8", "season" => 4, "number" => 8, "name" => "Six Bullets Appears, Part 2", "airdate" => "23 Nov 2018", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9.2, "summary" => "Mista's Stand, Six Bullets, fights against Sale and his stand, Arts and Crafts.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/197/493647.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s4e9", "season" => 4, "number" => 9, "name" => "The First Mission From the Boss", "airdate" => "30 Nov 2018", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9, "summary" => "Having found Polpo's treasure, Bruno is promoted to the role of capo. The mysterious boss of the organization gives them a mission: protect his daughter Trish and bring him to her safely. However, from the shadows an enemy watches.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/197/493652.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s4e10", "season" => 4, "number" => 10, "name" => "Hitman Team", "airdate" => "7 Dec 2018", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 8.8, "summary" => "A hit-man team, that seeks to overthrow the boss of the organization, begins to search for Trish. One of its members, Formaggio, attacks Narancia. Narancia fights back with his Aerosmith but Formaggio manages to hide from his attacks.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/197/493661.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s4e11", "season" => 4, "number" => 11, "name" => "Narancia's Aerosmith", "airdate" => "14 Dec 2018", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9, "summary" => "Narancia continues to shrink due to the power of Formaggio's Little Feet. His Stand shrinks as well and his attacks barely affect the relentless Formaggio. Narancia tries to think of a way out as Formaggio tortures him for Trish's location.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/197/493662.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s4e12", "season" => 4, "number" => 12, "name" => "The Second Mission from the Boss", "airdate" => "21 Dec 2018", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 8.4, "summary" => "Fugo, Abbachio, and Giorno head to Pompeii to retrieve a key for the boss. However, another member of the hit-man team, Illuso, attacks them with his Stand, Man in the Mirror.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/197/493663.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s4e13", "season" => 4, "number" => 13, "name" => "Man in the Mirror and Purple Haze", "airdate" => "28 Dec 2018", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 8.6, "summary" => "Fugo is still trapped in the mirror world due to Man in the Mirror, who continues its attack. Giorno and Abbachio try to think of a way to save their friend as Fugo's Purple Haze rampages in the real world.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/197/493664.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s4e14", "season" => 4, "number" => 14, "name" => "Express Train to Florence", "airdate" => "11 Jan 2019", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9, "summary" => "Using the power of the key in conjunction with a turtle, the gang hides on a train bound for Venice. However, two members of the hit-man team board as well, with Prosciutto unleashing his Stand on the hapless passengers.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/197/493665.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s4e15", "season" => 4, "number" => 15, "name" => "The Grateful Dead Part 1", "airdate" => "18 Jan 2019", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9.2, "summary" => "The Grateful Dead slowly begins to age everybody on the train. With his teammates affected, Mista goes alone to confront the enemy, only to encounter Pesci and his Beach Boy.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/197/493666.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s4e16", "season" => 4, "number" => 16, "name" => "The Grateful Dead Part 2", "airdate" => "25 Jan 2019", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9.6, "summary" => "To protect his teammates, Bruno manages to knock Prosciutto off the train to negate the aging power of The Grateful Dead, However, Pesci's resolve is hardened seeing his brother fight and he continues to attack Bruno.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/197/493667.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s4e17", "season" => 4, "number" => 17, "name" => "Baby Face", "airdate" => "1 Feb 2019", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 8.2, "summary" => "The gang tries to steal a car to travel to Venice in secret. Another hit-man, Melone, uses his Baby Face to impregnate a woman and create a soldier that pursues Giorno and the others.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/197/493668.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s4e18", "season" => 4, "number" => 18, "name" => "Head to Venice!", "airdate" => "8 Feb 2019", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 8.8, "summary" => "With Baby Face defeated, the group continues driving to Venice. A chill is in the air however, as Ghiaccio and his cold manipulating White Album unleash a barrage of ice attacks on Giorno and Mista.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/197/493669.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s4e19", "season" => 4, "number" => 19, "name" => "White Ice", "airdate" => "15 Feb 2019", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9, "summary" => "Giorno drives into the canals of Venice in the hope of shaking off Ghiaccio. However, his White Album only operates better in ice, especially when he unleashes the power of his Gently Weeps.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/197/493670.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s4e20", "season" => 4, "number" => 20, "name" => "The Final Mission from the Boss", "airdate" => "22 Feb 2019", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9.4, "summary" => "The boss gives the gang one final mission: deliver Trish to the top of a bell tower. Bruno takes Trish to the tower, reflecting on his past arriving to this point, but that's when the boss reveals his horrific true nature.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/197/493671.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s4e21", "season" => 4, "number" => 21, "name" => "The Mystery of Emperor Crimson", "airdate" => "1 Mar 2019", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9.8, "summary" => "Bruno continues his desperate struggle against the boss, but cannot comprehend the nature of his Stand, King Crimson. When the dust settles, a decision is made that will change the lives of the gang forever.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/197/493672.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s4e22", "season" => 4, "number" => 22, "name" => "The \"G\" in Gozzo", "airdate" => "15 Mar 2019", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 8.8, "summary" => "Stopping for lunch at a cafe, the gang tries to determine what to do now that they are enemies of the Passione organization. Members of the elite squad then attack, unleashing the power of their Stands: Clash and Talking Head.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/197/493673.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s4e23", "season" => 4, "number" => 23, "name" => "Crush and Talking Mouth", "airdate" => "22 Mar 2019", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 8.6, "summary" => "Squalo's Clash and Tiziano's Talking Head continue their combination attack to kill Giorno and finish off the gang. Forced to only tell lies, Narancia has to try to get his friends to go after the real enemy and save Giorno's life.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/197/493674.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s4e24", "season" => 4, "number" => 24, "name" => "Notorious B.I.G", "airdate" => "29 Mar 2019", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 8.8, "summary" => "The gang manage to acquire a plane and aim to fly to Sardinia, after dispatching an enemy. However, once they are in the air, they find themselves under attack by a powerful and terrifying foe.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/197/493675.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s4e25", "season" => 4, "number" => 25, "name" => "Spice Girl", "airdate" => "5 Apr 2019", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9, "summary" => "On the verge of death, Trish discovers and unlocks a Stand power.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/197/493676.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s4e26", "season" => 4, "number" => 26, "name" => "A Little Story From the Past ~My Name Is Doppio~", "airdate" => "12 Apr 2019", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9, "summary" => "On the island of Sardinia, a boy named Doppio is searching for Trish and the others on orders from Passione's boss. But Doppio has a dark secret, one that becomes apparent when he encounters Risotto of La Squadra.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/197/493677.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s4e27", "season" => 4, "number" => 27, "name" => "King Crimson vs Metallica", "airdate" => "19 Apr 2019", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9.4, "summary" => "Doppio, the alter ego of Passione's boss, continues to fight against Risotto and his iron controlling Metallica. Doppio struggles against the powerful assassin, but is armed with King Crimson's Epitaph, which allows him to see the future.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/197/493678.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s4e28", "season" => 4, "number" => 28, "name" => "Beneath a Sky on the Verge of Falling", "airdate" => "26 Apr 2019", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9.8, "summary" => "In the aftermath of the battle between Risotto and Doppio, Abbacchio uses Moody Blues to try and uncover the boss's identity. But the boss is adamant about keeping his identity a secret and executes his next gambit against the group.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/197/493679.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s4e29", "season" => 4, "number" => 29, "name" => "Get to the Roman Colosseum!", "airdate" => "10 May 2019", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 8.8, "summary" => "Unsure of what to do next, the gang receive a strange message on their computer revealing the origins of the Stand arrow and the true name of Passione's boss. The gang aim to travel to Rome as two assassins wait in the shadows.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/197/493680.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s4e30", "season" => 4, "number" => 30, "name" => "Green Day and Oasis, Part 1", "airdate" => "17 May 2019", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9.2, "summary" => "The gang are under attack by the last two members of the Elite Squad. Cioccolata uses his Green Day to spread a toxic mold over the island while Secco uses Oasis to swim through rock for stealth attacks, leaving the gang in a pinch.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/198/497047.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s4e31", "season" => 4, "number" => 31, "name" => "Green Day and Oasis, Part 2", "airdate" => "24 May 2019", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9.4, "summary" => "While Bruno stays on the ground to fight against Secco's Oasis, Giorno and Mista head upwards towards Cioccolata to stop the power of his Green Day. But Cioccolata has another dangerous trick up his sleeve, pushing the two into a corner.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/200/500499.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s4e32", "season" => 4, "number" => 32, "name" => "Green Day and Oasis, Part 3", "airdate" => "31 May 2019", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9.4, "summary" => "Bruno and Secco are both racing towards the man at the Colloseum whilst trying to kill each other.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/201/502729.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s4e33", "season" => 4, "number" => 33, "name" => "His Name Is Diavolo", "airdate" => "7 Jun 2019", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9.4, "summary" => "Bruno unknowingly leads Doppio to the Colosseum while the rest of the gang is searching for their leader.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/201/504522.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s4e34", "season" => 4, "number" => 34, "name" => "The Requiem Quietly Plays, Part 1", "airdate" => "14 Jun 2019", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9.2, "summary" => "Everyone wakes up from a deep sleep to discover their souls have been swapped.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/202/505878.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s4e35", "season" => 4, "number" => 35, "name" => "The Requiem Quietly Plays, Part 2", "airdate" => "21 Jun 2019", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9.8, "summary" => "The gang desperately tries to reach the Stand arrow whilst looking for Diavolo.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/203/508136.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s4e36", "season" => 4, "number" => 36, "name" => "Diavolo Surfaces", "airdate" => "28 Jun 2019", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9.2, "summary" => "Everyone continues to desperately chase after the Requiem in order to obtain the Stand arrow. Diavolo's soul is then forced to show itself, but he will not quit until he obtains the arrow for himself.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/203/509925.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s4e37", "season" => 4, "number" => 37, "name" => "King Of Kings", "airdate" => "5 Jul 2019", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9.6, "summary" => "The Stand arrow's rightful owner is finally revealed.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/204/511357.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s4e38", "season" => 4, "number" => 38, "name" => "Golden Experience Requiem", "airdate" => "28 Jul 2019", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9, "summary" => "Giorno achieves his dream and destiny of becoming a Gang-star.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/207/517701.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s4e39", "season" => 4, "number" => 39, "name" => "The Sleeping Slave", "airdate" => "28 Jul 2019", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9.4, "summary" => "In the past, Bruno and his team investigated the mysterious death of a girl and how it ties into the power known as Rolling Stones. And in the present, the final fate of Giorno and the gang is revealed as Golden Wind comes to a close.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/207/517702.jpg"),
    )),
    array("number" => 5, "name" => "Stone Ocean", "rating" => 8.9, "episodes" => array(
        array("id" => "s5e1", "season" => 5, "number" => 1, "name" => "Stone Ocean", "airdate" => "1 Dec 2021", "runtime" => 24, "rating" => 8.8, "summary" => "Florida, 2011. Framed for a DUI and imprisoned, young Jolyne gains a mysterious new power after receiving a bizarre item from her estranged father.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/445/1113619.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s5e2", "season" => 5, "number" => 2, "name" => "Prisoner FE40536: Jolyne Cujoh", "airdate" => "1 Dec 2021", "runtime" => 24, "rating" => 8.8, "summary" => "Jolyne gets acquainted with Green Dolphin Street Prison and her two-faced cellmate, Gwess, who has obtained Jolyne's locket and a pint-sized new Stand.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/445/1113620.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s5e3", "season" => 5, "number" => 3, "name" => "The Visitor (1)", "airdate" => "1 Dec 2021", "runtime" => 24, "rating" => 8.8, "summary" => "Jolyne acclimates to prison, but a mysterious boy delivers an ominous message before Jolyne receives a visit from her father and an enemy Stand user.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/445/1113621.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s5e4", "season" => 5, "number" => 4, "name" => "The Visitor (2)", "airdate" => "1 Dec 2021", "runtime" => 24, "rating" => 9, "summary" => "DIO's follower Johngalli A. aims for revenge. The boy risks his safety to help Jotaro and Jolyne, but she refuses to leave the kid behind.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/445/1113622.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s5e5", "season" => 5, "number" => 5, "name" => "Prisoner of Love", "airdate" => "1 Dec 2021", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9.2, "summary" => "Father and daughter try to escape the visiting room's trap and the prison, but an enemy Stand extracts two discs from Jotaro. One holds Star Platinum.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/445/1113623.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s5e6", "season" => 5, "number" => 6, "name" => "Ermes's Stickers", "airdate" => "1 Dec 2021", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 8.4, "summary" => "Jolyne returns to prison to retrieve Jotaro's discs. Ermes Costello discovers her new ability and a guard with discs in his head before she's attacked.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/445/1113624.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s5e7", "season" => 5, "number" => 7, "name" => "There's Six of Us!", "airdate" => "1 Dec 2021", "runtime" => 24, "rating" => 8.4, "summary" => "After people go missing from the prison's farm, Jolyne and Ermes volunteer to join the search party as a way to look for Pale Snake and the discs.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/445/1113625.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s5e8", "season" => 5, "number" => 8, "name" => "F.F.", "airdate" => "1 Dec 2021", "runtime" => 24, "rating" => 8.6, "summary" => "Jolyne and Ermes unravel the mystery of Stand F.F. and its user, who admits to helping Pale Snake in his efforts to steal their Stands.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/445/1113626.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s5e9", "season" => 5, "number" => 9, "name" => "Debt Collector Mary Lynn Manson", "airdate" => "1 Dec 2021", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9, "summary" => "Pale Snake's user, Father Pucchi, makes his entrance. A baseball game in the yard against Miraschon heats up when F.F. and Stone Ocean get involved.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/445/1113627.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s5e10", "season" => 5, "number" => 10, "name" => "Operation Savage Guardian (Head to the Courtyard!) (1)", "airdate" => "1 Dec 2021", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 8.8, "summary" => "Assisted by Emporio and his friend Weather Forecast, Jolyne rushes to the courtyard to pass Jotaro's Stand Disc to the Speedwagon Foundation.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/445/1113628.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s5e11", "season" => 5, "number" => 11, "name" => "Operation Savage Guardian (Head to the Courtyard!) (2)", "airdate" => "1 Dec 2021", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9.2, "summary" => "Father Pucchi learns some damning information. Jolyne and Weather's bodies strain under Jumpin' Jack Spark's Stand ability as the fight continues.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/445/1113629.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s5e12", "season" => 5, "number" => 12, "name" => "Torrential Downpour Warning", "airdate" => "1 Dec 2021", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9.2, "summary" => "Jolyne reaches the courtyard. Pucchi recalls his talks with DIO and his reason for hunting Jotaro when Weather unleashes a squall of poison dart frogs.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/445/1113630.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s5e13", "season" => 5, "number" => 13, "name" => "Kiss of Love and Revenge (1)", "airdate" => "1 Sep 2022", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 8.6, "summary" => "Jolyne and F.F. discover that Ermes got herself sent to prison to track down and kill a notorious gangster who murdered her older sister.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/445/1113634.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s5e14", "season" => 5, "number" => 14, "name" => "Kiss of Love and Revenge (2)", "airdate" => "1 Sep 2022", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 8.6, "summary" => "Ermes, Jolyne and F.F. find out that Maxx has turned into an invisible zombie and escaped from the pipe. Maxx lures them into the prison's mausoleum and revives several dead prisoners. ", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/445/1113635.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s5e15", "season" => 5, "number" => 15, "name" => "Ultra Security House Unit", "airdate" => "1 Sep 2022", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 8.8, "summary" => "F.F. and Emporio find out that forced Maxx was forced to bring one of DIO's bones back to life. Narciso Anasui agrees to help F.F. rescue Jolyne.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/445/1113641.jpg"),
